copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Looking for the perfect tier?.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #6B33E3, secondary #0A0A0A, accent #6B33E3, background #0A0A0A, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Platform Overview</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white font-sans antialiased selection:bg-[#6b33e3]/30\">\n\n    <!-- Main Container with Background Grid -->\n    <div class=\"relative max-w-[1100px] mx-auto min-h-screen\">\n\n        <!-- Container-sized Lines & Beam Animations -->\n        <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none w-full h-full opacity-60\"></canvas>\n\n        <main class=\"relative z-10 px-6 py-24\">\n\n            <!-- FAQ Section -->\n            <section class=\"max-w-3xl mb-16\">\n                <div class=\"border-t border-white/10\">\n                    <div class=\"py-6 border-b border-white/10 flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer group\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm font-normal text-white/80 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">What uptime guarantees do you offer?</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-white/40 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"py-6 border-b border-white/10 flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer group\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm font-normal text-white/80 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Which global regions are supported?</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-white/40 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Structural Divider -->\n            <div class=\"w-full border-t border-white/10 my-16\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Banner Section -->\n            <section class=\"relative bg-[#6b33e3] rounded-sm overflow-hidden p-10 md:p-16 min-h-[360px] flex items-center\">\n                <!-- Canvas Animation Background (Waves, Particles, Shooting Lines) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <canvas id=\"wave-canvas\" class=\"w-full h-full\"></canvas>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Content -->\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start gap-12\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-12 max-w-md\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight font-normal text-white leading-tight\">\n                            Looking for the perfect tier?\n                        </h2>\n\n                        <!-- Banner Button -->\n                        <div class=\"border border-dashed border-white/30 p-1 inline-block group cursor-pointer hover:border-white/60 transition-colors duration-500 self-start\">\n                            <button class=\"relative w-44 h-24 border border-white/30 bg-transparent hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between p-4\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full flex justify-end\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-lg text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full text-left\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-sm font-normal text-white\">Connect Now</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"max-w-xs md:pt-3\">\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-white/80 leading-relaxed\">\n                            Our experts are ready to walk you through the options and find your ideal setup.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Structural Divider -->\n            <div class=\"w-full border-t border-white/10 my-16\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Footer Section (Remixed with dashed border and corner squares) -->\n            <div class=\"mt-16 border border-dashed border-white/20 p-1 relative group/footer hover:border-white/40 transition-colors duration-500\">\n\n                <!-- Corner Mini Squares -->\n                <div class=\"absolute -top-[3px] -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/40 bg-[#0a0a0a] group-hover/footer:border-white/60 transition-colors duration-500\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute -top-[3px] -right-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/40 bg-[#0a0a0a] group-hover/footer:border-white/60 transition-colors duration-500\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[3px] -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/40 bg-[#0a0a0a] group-hover/footer:border-white/60 transition-colors duration-500\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[3px] -right-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/40 bg-[#0a0a0a] group-hover/footer:border-white/60 transition-colors duration-500\"></div>\n\n                <footer class=\"border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0a0a] p-8 flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between items-start gap-16\">\n\n                    <!-- Left: Logo & Links -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-16 lg:gap-24 w-full lg:w-auto\">\n                        <div class=\"text-white shrink-0\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:planet-3-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-3xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap sm:flex-nowrap gap-12 sm:gap-20\">\n                            <!-- Column 1 -->\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                                <h4 class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/50 mb-1\">Engineering</h4>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Documentation</a>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Integrations</a>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Repositories</a>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                    Network Status\n                                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 block\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Updates</a>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Column 2 -->\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                                <h4 class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/50 mb-1\">Organization</h4>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Story</a>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Jobs</a>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Plans</a>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Terms</a>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Column 3 -->\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                                <h4 class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/50 mb-1\">Community</h4>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">X</a>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">LinkedIn</a>\n                                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-colors\">GitHub</a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Right: Action Buttons -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 shrink-0\">\n                        <!-- Footer Button 1 -->\n                        <div class=\"border border-dashed border-white/20 p-1 inline-block group cursor-pointer hover:border-white/40 transition-colors duration-500\">\n                            <button class=\"relative w-36 h-20 border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0a0a] hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between p-3\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full flex justify-end\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-base text-white/60 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full text-left flex flex-col leading-tight\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/90 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\">Talk to</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/90 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\">Sales</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Footer Button 2 -->\n                        <div class=\"border border-dashed border-white/20 p-1 inline-block group cursor-pointer hover:border-white/40 transition-colors duration-500\">\n                            <button class=\"relative w-36 h-20 border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0a0a] hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between p-3\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full flex justify-end\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-base text-white/60 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full text-left flex flex-col leading-tight\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/90 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\">Get</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/90 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\">Support</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </footer>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // Setup Background Canvas (Container Lines & Beams)\n            const bgCanvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n            const bgCtx = bgCanvas.getContext('2d');\n\n            // Setup Banner Canvas (Waves, Particles, Shooting Lines)\n            const waveCanvas = document.getElementById('wave-canvas');\n            const waveCtx = waveCanvas.getContext('2d');\n\n            let bgW, bgH, wW, wH;\n            let beams = [];\n            let shootingLines = [];\n            const cols = 6;\n\n            function resize() {\n                // Resize Background Canvas\n                const bgParent = bgCanvas.parentElement;\n                bgW = bgParent.offsetWidth;\n                bgH = bgParent.offsetHeight;\n                bgCanvas.width = bgW * window.devicePixelRatio;\n                bgCanvas.height = bgH * window.devicePixelRatio;\n                bgCtx.scale(window.devicePixelRatio, window.devicePixelRatio);\n\n                // Resize Wave Canvas\n                const waveParent = waveCanvas.parentElement;\n                wW = waveParent.offsetWidth;\n                wH = waveParent.offsetHeight;\n                waveCanvas.width = wW * window.devicePixelRatio;\n                waveCanvas.height = wH * window.devicePixelRatio;\n                waveCtx.scale(window.devicePixelRatio, window.devicePixelRatio);\n\n                // Re-initialize Beams\n                beams = [];\n                const spacing = bgW / cols;\n                for(let i = 1; i < cols; i++) {\n                    if(Math.random() > 0.3) {\n                        beams.push({\n                            x: i * spacing,\n                            y: Math.random() * bgH,\n                            length: 100 + Math.random() * 200,\n                            speed: 1.5 + Math.random() * 2\n                        });\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Re-initialize Shooting Lines\n                shootingLines = [];\n                for(let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n                    shootingLines.push({\n                        x: Math.random() * wW,\n                        y: Math.random() * wH,\n                        length: 80 + Math.random() * 150,\n                        speed: 6 + Math.random() * 8\n                    });\n                }\n            }\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            let time = 0;\n            function draw() {\n                time += 0.015;\n\n                // --- Draw Background Grid & Beams ---\n                bgCtx.clearRect(0, 0, bgW, bgH);\n                bgCtx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)';\n                bgCtx.lineWidth = 1;\n\n                const spacing = bgW / cols;\n                for(let i = 1; i < cols; i++) {\n                    bgCtx.beginPath();\n                    bgCtx.moveTo(i * spacing, 0);\n                    bgCtx.lineTo(i * spacing, bgH);\n                    bgCtx.stroke();\n                }\n\n                beams.forEach(beam => {\n                    beam.y += beam.speed;\n                    if (beam.y - beam.length > bgH) {\n                        beam.y = 0;\n                        beam.x = Math.floor(1 + Math.random() * (cols - 1)) * spacing;\n                    }\n                    const grad = bgCtx.createLinearGradient(0, beam.y - beam.length, 0, beam.y);\n                    grad.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)');\n                    grad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)');\n\n                    bgCtx.beginPath();\n                    bgCtx.moveTo(beam.x, beam.y - beam.length);\n                    bgCtx.lineTo(beam.x, beam.y);\n                    bgCtx.strokeStyle = grad;\n                    bgCtx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n                    bgCtx.stroke();\n                });\n\n                // --- Draw Banner Waves, Particles & Shooting Lines ---\n                waveCtx.clearRect(0, 0, wW, wH);\n\n                // Waves\n                for(let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n                    waveCtx.beginPath();\n                    waveCtx.strokeStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${0.1 + i * 0.05})`;\n                    waveCtx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n                    for(let x = 0; x <= wW; x += 20) {\n                        let y = wH / 2 + Math.sin(x * 0.004 + time + i) * 50 * (i + 1) / 2;\n                        if(x === 0) waveCtx.moveTo(x, y);\n                        else waveCtx.lineTo(x, y);\n                    }\n                    waveCtx.stroke();\n                }\n\n                // Particles\n                waveCtx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9)';\n                for(let i = 0; i < 15; i++) {\n                    let px = (time * 80 + i * (wW / 15)) % wW;\n                    let waveIdx = i % 3;\n                    let py = wH / 2 + Math.sin(px * 0.004 + time + waveIdx) * 50 * (waveIdx + 1) / 2;\n                    waveCtx.beginPath();\n                    waveCtx.arc(px, py, 1.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    waveCtx.fill();\n                }\n\n                // Shooting Lines\n                shootingLines.forEach(sl => {\n                    sl.x += sl.speed;\n                    if (sl.x - sl.length > wW) {\n                        sl.x = 0;\n                        sl.y = Math.random() * wH;\n                    }\n                    const grad = waveCtx.createLinearGradient(sl.x - sl.length, 0, sl.x, 0);\n                    grad.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)');\n                    grad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6)');\n\n                    waveCtx.beginPath();\n                    waveCtx.moveTo(sl.x - sl.length, sl.y);\n                    waveCtx.lineTo(sl.x, sl.y);\n                    waveCtx.strokeStyle = grad;\n                    waveCtx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n                    waveCtx.stroke();\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n            }\n            draw();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "platform-overview-3.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/platform-overview-3.jpg", "source_name": "platform-overview-3-DESIGN.md", "views": 70, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T10:45:35.432449+00:00"}